<div class="wb">
<section class="wb-hero wb-section"><div class="wb-wrap wb-hero-grid"><div><p class="wb-kicker">WHAT WE BUILD</p><h1>We don't build for an industry.<br><em>We build for the problem.</em></h1><p class="wb-lead">E Deviser finds difficult problems worth solving, understands what makes them difficult, and creates the intelligence, systems, and solutions needed to move them forward.</p><a class="wb-link" href="#way">Explore how we build ↓</a></div><div class="wb-field" aria-label="Fragmented signals converging into one intelligent solution"><div class="wb-fragments"></div><svg viewBox="0 0 700 430" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="wb-stream"><stop stop-color="#0382BD" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset=".34" stop-color="#0382BD" stop-opacity=".62"/><stop offset=".68" stop-color="#5AB9B4"/><stop offset=".88" stop-color="#C0E2FD"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#CDFCF4"/></linearGradient><radialGradient id="wb-glow"><stop stop-color="#FFFFFF"/><stop offset=".18" stop-color="#CDFCF4"/><stop offset=".42" stop-color="#5AB9B4" stop-opacity=".72"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#0382BD" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs><g class="wb-lines"><path d="M 24 20 l 13 -3 l 12 1 l 13 -5 l 14 6 C 155 8, 190 35, 220 16 C 340 -5, 420 191, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 36 l 13 1 l 12 -2 l 13 -2 l 14 2 C 155 24, 190 51, 220 32 C 340 11, 420 193, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 52 l 13 5 l 12 -5 l 13 1 l 14 -2 C 155 40, 190 67, 220 48 C 340 27, 420 195, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 68 l 13 9 l 12 -8 l 13 4 l 14 -6 C 155 56, 190 83, 220 64 C 340 43, 420 197, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 84 l 13 13 l 12 -11 l 13 7 l 14 -10 C 155 72, 190 99, 220 80 C 340 59, 420 199, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 100 l 13 -3 l 12 -14 l 13 10 l 14 6 C 155 88, 190 115, 220 96 C 340 75, 420 201, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 116 l 13 1 l 12 -17 l 13 13 l 14 2 C 155 104, 190 131, 220 112 C 340 91, 420 203, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 132 l 13 5 l 12 1 l 13 -5 l 14 -2 C 155 120, 190 147, 220 128 C 340 107, 420 205, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 148 l 13 9 l 12 -2 l 13 -2 l 14 -6 C 155 136, 190 163, 220 144 C 340 123, 420 207, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 164 l 13 13 l 12 -5 l 13 1 l 14 -10 C 155 152, 190 179, 220 160 C 340 139, 420 209, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 180 l 13 -3 l 12 -8 l 13 4 l 14 6 C 155 168, 190 195, 220 176 C 340 155, 420 211, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 196 l 13 1 l 12 -11 l 13 7 l 14 2 C 155 184, 190 211, 220 192 C 340 171, 420 213, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 212 l 13 5 l 12 -14 l 13 10 l 14 -2 C 155 200, 190 227, 220 208 C 340 187, 420 215, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 228 l 13 9 l 12 -17 l 13 13 l 14 -6 C 155 216, 190 243, 220 224 C 340 203, 420 217, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 244 l 13 13 l 12 1 l 13 -5 l 14 -10 C 155 232, 190 259, 220 240 C 340 219, 420 219, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 260 l 13 -3 l 12 -2 l 13 -2 l 14 6 C 155 248, 190 275, 220 256 C 340 235, 420 221, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 276 l 13 1 l 12 -5 l 13 1 l 14 2 C 155 264, 190 291, 220 272 C 340 251, 420 223, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 292 l 13 5 l 12 -8 l 13 4 l 14 -2 C 155 280, 190 307, 220 288 C 340 267, 420 225, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 308 l 13 9 l 12 -11 l 13 7 l 14 -6 C 155 296, 190 323, 220 304 C 340 283, 420 227, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 324 l 13 13 l 12 -14 l 13 10 l 14 -10 C 155 312, 190 339, 220 320 C 340 299, 420 229, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 340 l 13 -3 l 12 -17 l 13 13 l 14 6 C 155 328, 190 355, 220 336 C 340 315, 420 231, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 356 l 13 1 l 12 1 l 13 -5 l 14 2 C 155 344, 190 371, 220 352 C 340 331, 420 233, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 372 l 13 5 l 12 -2 l 13 -2 l 14 -2 C 155 360, 190 387, 220 368 C 340 347, 420 235, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 388 l 13 9 l 12 -5 l 13 1 l 14 -6 C 155 376, 190 403, 220 384 C 340 363, 420 237, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 404 l 13 13 l 12 -8 l 13 4 l 14 -10 C 155 392, 190 419, 220 400 C 340 379, 420 239, 585 215"/></g><circle cx="590" cy="215" r="80" fill="url(#wb-glow)"/><circle cx="590" cy="215" r="7" fill="white"/><path d="M590 110V320M485 215H690" class="wb-axis"/></svg><div class="wb-field-labels" aria-label="The kinds of complexity we work through">
<span>FRAGMENTED INFORMATION</span><span>COMPLEX SYSTEMS</span><span>CONSTANT CHANGE</span><span>HUMAN FACTORS</span><span>UNCERTAIN OUTCOMES</span><span>INTERCONNECTED PRESSURES</span>
</div><span class="wb-field-output">INTELLIGENT<br/>SOLUTION</span></div></div></section>
<section class="wb-section" id="why"><div class="wb-wrap wb-split"><div><p class="wb-kicker">WHY NOT ONE INDUSTRY?</p><h2>Because the hardest problems <em>don't fit neatly into one.</em></h2></div><div class="wb-copy"><p>Some problems are technological.<br/>Some are human.<br/>Some are systemic.<br/>Most are a combination of all three.</p><p>We don't believe every problem should be forced into the same product, technology, or industry playbook.</p></div></div><div class="wb-wrap wb-problem-map">
<div class="wb-dimension-stage" role="img" aria-label="Technology, people, and systems are distinct dimensions that connect to shape one shared problem">
  <div class="wb-dimension-grid">
    <article class="wb-dimension-card wb-dimension-tech">
      <div class="wb-dimension-meta"><span>01</span><i></i><small>DIMENSION</small></div>
      <div class="wb-dimension-symbol wb-symbol-tech" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b></b></div>
      <h3>TECHNOLOGY</h3>
      <p>Tools, systems &amp; data</p>
      <span class="wb-dimension-foot">CAPABILITY / INFRASTRUCTURE</span>
    </article>
    <article class="wb-dimension-card wb-dimension-people">
      <div class="wb-dimension-meta"><span>02</span><i></i><small>DIMENSION</small></div>
      <div class="wb-dimension-symbol wb-symbol-people" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b></b></div>
      <h3>PEOPLE</h3>
      <p>Needs, behavior &amp; experience</p>
      <span class="wb-dimension-foot">NEEDS / EXPERIENCE</span>
    </article>
    <article class="wb-dimension-card wb-dimension-systems">
      <div class="wb-dimension-meta"><span>03</span><i></i><small>DIMENSION</small></div>
      <div class="wb-dimension-symbol wb-symbol-systems" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b></b></div>
      <h3>SYSTEMS</h3>
      <p>Context, incentives &amp; change</p>
      <span class="wb-dimension-foot">CONTEXT / INTERDEPENDENCE</span>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="wb-dimension-bridge" aria-hidden="true">
    <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    <i class="wb-bridge-pulse"></i>
  </div>
  <div class="wb-intersection">
    <div class="wb-intersection-label"><i></i> THE POINT OF CONVERGENCE <i></i></div>
    <div class="wb-intersection-core">
      <span>WHERE THEY MEET</span>
      <b>THE PROBLEM</b>
      <small>WORTH SOLVING</small>
    </div>
    <p>One connected reality. Understood in full.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wb-dimension-coordinate wb-coordinate-left">MULTI-DIMENSIONAL BY NATURE</div>
  <div class="wb-dimension-coordinate wb-coordinate-right">NO SINGLE PLAYBOOK</div>
</div>
<p>Different forces. One problem worth understanding in full.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="wb-section wb-alt" id="way"><div class="wb-wrap"><p class="wb-kicker">OUR WAY OF BUILDING</p><div class="wb-head"><h2>Understand first.<br/><em>Build second.</em></h2><p>We go deep into a problem—its people, incentives, systems, constraints, evidence, and desired outcomes—before deciding what needs to exist.</p></div><div class="wb-methodology-track" aria-label="Six stages of our building methodology">
  <div class="wb-methodology-rail" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
  {[
    ['The Problem','A complex, messy real-world problem.','THE START'],
    ['Understand','We investigate the domain, constraints, people, systems, and evidence.','DISCOVER'],
    ['Design','We determine what intelligence, technology, and solution are actually required.','DEFINE'],
    ['Build','AI agents, software, data, automation, or whatever is appropriate.','CREATE'],
    ['Solution','A working system that solves the problem.','DELIVER'],
    ['Measure','Does it actually improve the outcome?','LEARN']
  ].map(([s,description,phase],i)=><article class="wb-method-step">
    <div class="wb-method-step-head"><span class="wb-method-number">0{i+1}</span><span class="wb-method-phase">{phase}</span></div>
    <div class="wb-method-node" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
    <div class="wb-method-step-body"><h3>{s}</h3><p>{description}</p></div>
    <div class="wb-method-art wb-method-art--{i+1}" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b></b></div>
    <span class="wb-method-step-index" aria-hidden="true">0{i+1}</span>
  </article>)}
</div><p class="wb-quote">We don't start by asking, <i>“What can this technology do?”</i><br/>We start by asking, <strong>“What would actually solve this?”</strong></p></div></section>
<section class="wb-section" id="toolkit"><div class="wb-wrap"><p class="wb-kicker">OUR TOOLKIT</p><div class="wb-head"><p class="wb-toolkit-eyebrow">TECHNOLOGY IS A MEANS.</p><h2>We use whatever the problem <em>demands.</em></h2><p>We don't begin with a technology and search for somewhere to use it. We begin with a problem and assemble the capabilities required to solve it.</p></div>
  <div class="wb-toolkit-constellation" role="img" aria-label="A central problem surrounded by seven capabilities: Agentic AI, Software, Data, Automation, Human expertise, Research, and Emerging technologies.">
    <div class="wb-toolkit-orbit wb-toolkit-orbit--outer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wb-toolkit-orbit wb-toolkit-orbit--inner" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wb-toolkit-connectors" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    <div class="wb-toolkit-core"><span>START WITH</span><b>THE<br/>PROBLEM</b><i></i><small>NOT THE TECHNOLOGY</small></div>
    {tools.map((tool,i)=><div class={`wb-toolkit-orb wb-toolkit-orb--${i+1}`}><span class="wb-toolkit-orb-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><b></b></span><strong>{tool}</strong></div>)}
    <span class="wb-toolkit-annotation wb-toolkit-annotation--left">CAPABILITIES IN COMBINATION</span>
    <span class="wb-toolkit-annotation wb-toolkit-annotation--right">SELECTED BY NEED</span>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="wb-section wb-alt" id="education"><div class="wb-wrap"><p class="wb-kicker">WHY EDUCATION, NOW?</p><div class="wb-head"><h2>Because learning is one of the most consequential—and complex—<em>systems we can work on.</em></h2><p>Education sits at the intersection of people, knowledge, behavior, institutions, technology, and systems. That's what makes it so difficult—and so important.</p></div><div class="wb-cards"><article><small>01 / COMPLEXITY</small><h3>Many forces, deeply connected.</h3><p>Learning is shaped by people, knowledge, behavior, institutions, curriculum, technology, and context.</p></article><article><small>02 / MEASUREMENT</small><h3>Outcomes over activity.</h3><p>What matters isn't simply activity or information. It's whether learning outcomes actually improve.</p></article><article><small>03 / SCALE</small><h3>Progress that can reach millions.</h3><p>Better ways of understanding and supporting learning can affect millions of learners across the region.</p></article></div><p class="wb-conclusion">That combination makes education a problem worth going deep on.</p></div></section>
<section class="wb-section wb-intelligence" id="intelligence"><div class="wb-wrap"><p class="wb-kicker">OUR INTELLIGENCE CAPABILITY</p><div class="wb-head"><h2>We build systems that think,<br/><em>so they can keep getting better.</em></h2><p>Our intelligence loop is at the core of everything we build. It allows our systems to understand deeply, reason clearly, act effectively, and learn continuously. That's how we create lasting impact.</p></div><div class="wb-intel-system" role="img" aria-label="A continuous intelligence cycle: understand, reason, act, and learn, feeding back into continuous improvement.">
  <div class="wb-intel-orbit wb-intel-orbit-outer"></div><div class="wb-intel-orbit wb-intel-orbit-inner"></div>
  <div class="wb-intel-sweep" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <svg class="wb-intel-connectors" viewBox="0 0 1000 620" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs><linearGradient id="wb-intel-flow"><stop stop-color="#0382BD" stop-opacity=".25"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#5AB9B4"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#CDFCF4" stop-opacity=".8"/></linearGradient></defs>
    <path d="M500 112 C720 100 820 210 805 310 C790 435 680 510 500 510 C320 510 210 435 195 310 C180 210 280 100 500 112Z"/>
    <path class="wb-intel-cross" d="M500 112 C500 200 500 230 500 310 M805 310 C690 310 620 310 500 310 M500 510 C500 420 500 380 500 310 M195 310 C310 310 380 310 500 310"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="wb-intel-core"><div class="wb-intel-core-orb"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span>THE ENGINE</span><b>CONTINUOUS<br/>IMPROVEMENT</b><small>Every cycle makes the system smarter.</small><em>INTELLIGENCE IN MOTION</em></div>
  {steps.map((s,i)=><article class={`wb-intel-node wb-intel-node-${i+1}`}>
    <div class="wb-intel-node-head"><small>{s[0]}</small><span>PHASE 0{i+1}</span></div><h3>{s[1]}</h3><p>{s[2]}</p><i class="wb-intel-node-pulse"></i>
  </article>)}
  <span class="wb-intel-caption wb-intel-caption-a">CONTEXT → CLARITY</span><span class="wb-intel-caption wb-intel-caption-b">ACTION → EVIDENCE</span>
</div><div class="wb-loop-foot"><p><b>Not a one-time output.</b><br/>A system that compounds.<br/><em>Intelligence that grows.</em></p><p>This loop powers every E Deviser solution—from platforms like Cuevo to custom systems we build.</p><p><b>Different problems.</b><br/>Same intelligence engine.<br/>Better outcomes.</p></div><a class="wb-link" href="/cuevo/">See it in action: Cuevo ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="wb-section wb-future" id="future"><div class="wb-wrap"><div class="wb-future-layout"><div class="wb-future-copy"><p class="wb-kicker">THE FUTURE</p><small class="wb-overline">THE PROBLEMS WILL CHANGE.</small><h2>The way we solve them <em>won’t.</em></h2><p class="wb-copy">We will keep looking for problems where better intelligence can create meaningful change—learning today, and whatever important problem comes next.</p><a class="wb-link" href="/company/careers-contact/">Talk to E Deviser →</a></div><div class="wb-future-visual" role="img" aria-label="An evolving horizon of new contexts, challenges, and possibilities, connected by an adaptive intelligence core."><div class="wb-future-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wb-future-aura" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wb-future-orbit wb-future-orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div><div class="wb-future-orbit wb-future-orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div><div class="wb-future-orbit wb-future-orbit-three" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div><svg class="wb-future-paths" viewBox="0 0 620 500" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="wb-future-flow"><stop stop-color="#0382BD" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset=".48" stop-color="#5AB9B4" stop-opacity=".9"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#CDFCF4" stop-opacity=".18"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M30 390 C145 350 170 280 270 260 S430 250 590 70"/><path d="M20 440 C160 390 205 330 300 300 S465 280 610 150"/><path d="M65 470 C170 425 220 390 320 355 S475 345 590 250"/></svg><div class="wb-future-core"><span>THE NEXT</span><b>QUESTION</b><small>IS ALWAYS<br/>WORTH EXPLORING</small><i></i></div><div class="wb-future-label wb-future-label-a"><i></i><span>NEW CONTEXTS</span></div><div class="wb-future-label wb-future-label-b"><i></i><span>NEW CHALLENGES</span></div><div class="wb-future-label wb-future-label-c"><i></i><span>NEW POSSIBILITIES</span></div><div class="wb-future-index">01 <span>—</span> OPEN HORIZON</div><div class="wb-future-foot">ADAPTIVE BY NATURE <i></i> PURPOSE-LED BY DESIGN</div></div></div></div></section>
</div>
